Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Paper mass and mixing plots", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"bf7960a4-514a-4a2c-a529-e31afd6014d8"],

Cell["\<\
Save this notebook in plotting/. Click inside the input cell below and press \
Shift+Enter. Select either the compact-data folder or the parent containing \
all four original production folders. No definitions package or simulation is \
required.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"45dddee1-7590-4b45-b5a9-003d387a1fb6"],

Cell["\<\
The exporter checks all 36 benchmarks before writing the 60 paper PDFs. It \
accepts original WXF files and CompactProductionData version 1, preserving \
the sample selection and original batch grouping. Choose one production \
version per case.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"72f2144a-74d3-4807-921e-7256a7cce0f2"],

Cell["\<\
Weak-site angles use 0-60 degrees. Strong-site and weak-hopping angles use \
0-90 degrees. The earlier large-font layout is retained, with larger filled \
circles for the mass-median legends.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"345b5a81-ea90-46b6-b7bd-1774883e38c8"],

