Cell["\<\
Outputs go to a new PaperPlots_<timestamp>_<id>/figures folder beside this \
notebook. The parent output folder also contains plot_export_report.wxf and \
expected_filenames.txt. Existing PDFs are not overwritten.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"501aa047-500a-49d5-b20a-fb35e4d270eb"],

Cell["\<\
This is the fixed-paper exporter. It stops if parameters, sample counts, \
selection counts or angle-bin counts differ from the earlier paper manifest. \
Newly fitted or deliberately changed benchmarks require a separate \
exploratory exporter.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b1db8c48-6638-49b8-9795-bdac5ad339a5"],

